5. **Monitor Your Bank Statement**: Keep an eye on your bank statement to ensure that the charges are indeed duplicates and not just pending transactions.

6. **Request a Refund**: If it is confirmed that you were charged twice, ask the customer support team for a refund for the duplicate charge.

7. **Follow Up**: If you don’t receive a timely response or resolution, follow up with customer support to ensure your issue is being addressed.

If the issue persists, you may also consider disputing the charge with your bank or credit card provider.
